    "intro_narrative": "You are an elite cyber-operative infiltrated into the subterranean data-fortress of a rogue intelligence syndicate known as 'The Vanguard'. Their localized server grid is primed to launch a global blackout virus, plunging the world into digital darkness within the hour. The underground facility is eerily deserted, completely locked down, and humming with heavily encrypted server racks and blinking indicator lights. Your objective is clear but daunting: you must navigate this maze of interconnected hardware, bypass their intricate, multi-layered security protocols, and trace the physical and digital data pathways. Every module, from signal synchronizers to power processors, plays a vital part in their defense web. You must intercept the scattered data fragments, route them through the correct processing nodes, and finally execute a master system override at the central uplink before the doomsday countdown reaches zero. Time is ticking.",
